WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.334
Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers. And this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:04.801
We hope you're doing well, and now if you don't mind,

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.000
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.234
President Biden informed Congress yesterday

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:09.734
that he will officially end

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:13.100
the coronavirus pandemic emergency declaration in May,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.234
which means that everyone can finally

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:17.501
stop wearing their mask a year ago.

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:19.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.601
President Biden visited New York City today

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:24.300
and spoke about how the bipartisan infrastructure law

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.467
will improve the Hudson River Tunnel

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.200
that connects New York and New Jersey.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.400
The biggest improvement --

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.067
it will no longer connect to New Jersey.

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:33.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.634
[ Applause ]

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:38.200
The Biden administration unveiled a proposal yesterday

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.968
that would make birth control more easily accessible.

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.968
That's great. Now can you do razors?

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:46.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.200
President Biden confirmed last week

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.467
that White House chief of staff Ron Klain

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.868
will step down in the coming weeks and said,

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:54.667
"The real mark of Ron's success

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:57.234
is that he's beloved by the team he leads."

00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:59.868
Though I'd say the real mark of Ron's success

00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:03.167
is that this is the first we're all hearing of him.

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:05.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.167
President Biden is set to travel to Philadelphia this week

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.067
to discuss an infrastructure project

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:12.334
that will replace lead pipes.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:16.000
But then how are Philadelphians supposed to collect their debts?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:24.667
According to a new survey, people don't want their partners

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:27.801
to earn less than $30,000 a year.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.467
This news first reported

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:32.200
by a guidance counselor to a philosophy major.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.634
"But, like, can you even name one who's working today?"

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.400
After vacationing for the last month in Orlando,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.801
former Brazilian president Jair Bolsonaro

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:46.667
has reportedly applied for a six-month visitor visa.

00:01:46.667 --> 00:01:48.267
I'm sorry.

00:01:48.267 --> 00:01:52.334
You saw Orlando and wanted to stay longer?

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:53.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.634 --> 00:01:57.000
"An IHOP and an Applebee's!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.100
Call the consulate and tell them I'm not leaving!"

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:04.367
The U.K. announced plans today to improve its environment

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:07.501
and hopes to restore at least 1.2 million acres

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:10.367
of wildlife habitat to protect rare species

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.234
like hedgehogs and red squirrels.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:14.801
Because if those die out,

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.701
it could mean the end of the traditional English breakfast.

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:19.133
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:21.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:24.767
[British accent] "The best we can do is Impossible hedgehog."

00:02:24.767 --> 00:02:29.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.667
Florida law-- [ Laughs ]

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:34.834
Florida lawmakers proposed legislation yesterday

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:37.767
that would allow residents to carry firearms without a permit.

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.133
I don't know. I guess they figure

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.868
it can't be any more dangerous

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:43.067
than letting 100-year-olds drive.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:45.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.734
And, finally, according to a new study,

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:49.534
kids missed about 35% of a normal year's worth

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:51.534
of learning during the coronavirus pandemic.

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:55.901
Said kids, "Oh, my God! That's more than half a year!"

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.968
And that was the monologue, everybody!

